### REST API best-practice checks — point @baseUrl at staging
### Run with the VS Code REST Client extension, JetBrains HTTP Client, or `httpyac`.
@baseUrl = {{$dotenv API_BASE_URL}}
@token = {{$dotenv API_TOKEN}}

### 1. Health check — expect 200 and p95 < 200ms
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Unauthenticated request — expect 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users
Accept: application/json

### 3. Authenticated, paginated request — expect 200 + pagination fields
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Oversized page — expect 400 or clamped size (never 10000 items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users?page=1&size=10000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Forbidden role — expect 403 Forbidden for a non-admin token
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Rate-limit headers — repeat quickly; expect X-RateLimit-* headers, then 429 + Retry-After
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users?page=1&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Idempotent create — same Idempotency-Key twice must not create two resources
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: check-2026-001

{"product_id": "SKU-123", "quantity": 1}

### 8. Schema validation — extra/malformed fields must be rejected (400) or ignored per policy
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "not-an-email", "unexpected_field": true}

### 9. Structured error body — expect machine code + message, not an HTML page
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/does-not-exist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
